OL,3,ACavern Club sold to new owners after 35
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool's Cavern Club and Magical
OL,7,FMystery Tour have new owners after 35
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FA group called 14 Collective have
OL,11,Fbought Cavern City Tours, which also
OL,12,Fincludes the Cavern Pub and Restaurant.
OL,14,FJohn Lennon's sister, Julia Baird, who
OL,15,Fwas one of the previous owners, said
OL,16,Fshe felt "sad for me personally, yet
OL,17,Fpositive for the future of this world
OL,18,Ffamous, number one music club", adding
OL,19,Fthat it was being left "in good hands".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
